Schema: business_owners + is_business_owner() RLS (additive, alongside
existing admin policies), orders/order_items, product_interest +
product_restock_events, nudge_rules/nudge_sends/nudge_opt_outs,
business_subscriptions. Migrations 0014-0018.

- /portal: business-owner login, dashboard, conversations (read +
  resolve own handoffs), nudge rule management, manual order log
- lib/nudges/: opt-out detection, quiet-hours check, WhatsApp template
  sender, the hourly rule-checking engine
- app/api/cron/nudges: CRON_SECRET-protected endpoint; vercel.json
  wires up the hourly schedule
- WhatsApp webhook: opt-out handling, reply tracking, and delivery/read
  status updates (value.statuses) alongside existing inbound handling
- Admin Settings: invite/remove portal owners, set plan/Nudges tier

See CHANGES.md for exactly what's functional now vs. blocked on Meta
template approval, and the scope calls made where the spec didn't say
(billing = manual flag, orders = manually logged, web channel excluded
from Nudges entirely).
